OL,3,GNEWSAI will make final decision on
OL,4,ARosebank oil field, energy secretary
OL,5,Ainsists
OL,6,
OL,7,FEnergy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh has
OL,8,Finsisted she will make the final
OL,9,Fdecision over whether to approve the
OL,10,Fcontroversial Rosebank oil field, not
OL,11,Fthe prime minister or chancellor.
OL,13,FShe said there was a "tight" framework
OL,14,Finvolved in making the decision to
OL,15,Favoid it being overturned in the
OL,16,Fcourts, and she was the only one who
OL,17,Fcould make the final choice about
OL,18,Fwhether to give the scheme the
OL,19,Fgo-ahead.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
