OL,3,GNEWSAI will make final decision on
OL,4,ARosebank oil field, energy secretary
OL,5,Ainsists
OL,6,
OL,7,FRosebank, which is about 80 miles
OL,8,F(128km) north-west of Shetland, is
OL,9,FBritain's largest untapped oil field
OL,10,Fand would also produce some gas.
OL,12,FIt comes after the UK government
OL,13,Fapproved production from the Jackdaw
OL,14,Fgas field in the North Sea.
